license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: |
  HiOmicsFormer is a novel deep learning framework for integrative multi-omics
  analysis that enables unsupervised cancer subtype discovery and biomarker
  identification. By leveraging hierarchical transformer architectures with
  cross-omics contrastive learning, HiOmicsFormer integrates four complementary
  omics modalities (mRNA, miRNA, DNA methylation, and copy number variation)
  from 8,314 patients across 32 cancer types in The Cancer Genome Atlas (TCGA).

